""}, "Categories": {"value": "Self-published work|Cycling route signs in Hungary|Information boards in Hungary|Files with coordinates missing SDC location of creation|July 2024 Hungary photographs|Bilingual English-Hungarian signs in Hungary|2024 in Mohács|Szent János utca, Mohács|Bikeways in Mohács", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "Assessments": {"value": "", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "GPSLatitude": {"value": "45.992097", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "GPSLongitude": {"value": "18.694308", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "GPSMapDatum": {"value": "WGS-84", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "ImageDescription": {"value": "<br>\n<dl><dd>End of Amazon of Europe Bike Trail information board Stage N11 Suza-Mohács. The Amazon of Europe Bike Trail is an international long-distance cycling trail offering you an unique opportunity for cycling holidays, following the natural meanders of the rivers Mura, Drava and Danube, for over 1,250 km. The cycle tour leads you along both sides of these rivers, with their North and South Routes. MORE here: aoebiketrail.com/ Local (Stage N11 Suza-Mohács, Croatia-Hungary, 56 km long) 'must see' (along the trail) 1.Baranja surduk a local nature and human activity phenomenom 2. Green Island, a weeken village along Danube riverbank 3. Batina Memorial Home. Built for all participiants in the Battle of Batina (1944) 4. Mohács National Memorial Site 5. Béda Protected Area, that is part of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danube-Drava_National_Park\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Danube-Drava National Park\">Danube-Drava National Park</a>.  6. Mohács. It is the own of the \"busó\" which is part of the Unesco  Spiritual Heritage -  Szent János Street, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moh%C3%A1cs\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Mohács\">Mohács</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baranya_County\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Baranya County\">Baranya County</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hungary\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Hungary\">Hungary</a>.</dd></dl>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "Taken in July 2024", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Artist": {"value": "<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Globetrotter19\" title=\"User:Globetrotter19\">Globetrotter19</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "LicenseShortName": {"value": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "UsageTerms": {"value": "Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 4.0", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "AttributionRequired": {"value": "true", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "LicenseUrl": {"value": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Copyrighted": {"value": "True", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Restrictions": {"value": "", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "License": {"value": "cc-by-sa-4.0", "source": "commons-templates", "hidden": ""}}}]}, {"pageid": 152769920, "ns": 6, "title": "File:Donaupromenade, Donau-Drau-Nationalpark Tafel, Poller, 2024 Mohács.jpg", "index": 2, "imagerepository": "local", "imageinfo": [{"size": 890974, "width": 1575, "height": 2100, "thumburl": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Donaupromenade%2C_Donau-Drau-Nationalpark_Tafel%2C_Poller%2C_2024_Moh%C3%A1cs.jpg/1280px-Donaupromenade%2C_Donau-Drau-Nationalpark_Tafel%2C_Poller%2C_2024_Moh%C3%A1cs.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "thumbwidth": 1280, "thumbheight": 1707, "responsiveUrls": {"2": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/89/Donaupromenade%2C_Donau-Drau-Nationalpark_Tafel%2C_Poller%2C_2024_Moh%C3%A1cs.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled"}, "thumbattribs": {"src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/w